Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Construct competing explanations from process history and defect patterns. Separate correlation with a shift, supplier, or operator from demonstrated cause, and formulate approved tests that could distinguish the mechanisms without unsafe experimentation.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
